environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Arts Building (Creative Arts Quadrant, SUCC Campus);
Setting: Boisterous, paint-splattered creative complex housing fine arts, sculpture studios, and music practice suites;
Factions: Department of Fine Arts, Music & Theater Collective, Student Artists;
Conflicts: Clashing noise between brass band rehearsals and quiet oil painting studios, clay dust cleanup;
Society: Uninhibited creative passion, artistic eccentricity, vibrant student expression, open studio camaraderie]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Pungent aroma of oil paint, turpentine, damp clay, sawdust, acrylic glaze, and distant trumpet scales;
Architecture: High-ceilinged industrial studio lofts with colossal skylights facing north, outdoor kiln courtyards, soundproof practice rooms;
Security & Wards: Heavy fire-suppression equipment around ceramics kilns, soundproof acoustic damping in music wings;
Demographics: Sculptors, painters, musicians, theatrical costume designers, creative visionaries;
Rules & Restrictions: Clean personal palettes and brushes in wash sinks, store solvent rags in fireproof disposal bins]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: The historic creative incubator of the university, producing celebrated supernatural sculptors and painters;
Secrets: The sculpture courtyard features a monumental rough marble block that slowly shifts form according to local emotional vibes]
